    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Maths feels like a natural extension of my fascination for economics—it’s a structured way to explore patterns. Since I enjoy solving problems logically, it’s become both useful and satisfying. Though my formal education was limited, I find it intuitive when applied to real-world scenarios, like budgeting or planning hikes.",
